<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 3.0 bln skr in four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 3.0 bln skr in four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office invited bids on Wednesday for an auction of 3.0 billion crowns of four-year bonds.</p>
<p>Bids have to be entered by 1030 GMT on October 16.</p>
<p>					     Loan 1036</p>
<p> Auction date				Oct 16</p>
<p> Maturity date			     May 5, 2000</p>
<p> Coupon  (pct)			     10.25 percent</p>
<p> Amount to the market (billions)     3.0</p>
<p> Settlement date			   Oct 21</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
